cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software version and the source publications of the reference data you use."
type: software
title: "ORsearcher: genome-based insect OR discovery and model polishing"
version: 2.3.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/veryxing565/ORsearcher"
authors:
  - name: "ORsearcher contributors"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  ORsearcher combines genome-wide protein-guided candidate discovery,
  structural review, OR/GR evidence competition, coding-overlap consolidation
  and bounded local reconstruction. Predictions are computational gene models,
  not experimental confirmation of receptor identity or function.
keywords:
  - insect
  - olfactory receptor
  - genome annotation
  - bioinformatics
